on_aureliano_babilonia.jpg","updated_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00"},"person_aureliano_jose":{"created_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00","gender":"male","generation_id":"gen_demo2_03","id":"person_aureliano_jose","introduction":"Aureliano José。上校与庇拉尔的儿子。先由蕾梅黛丝认作长子，后来由阿玛兰妲收养；阿玛兰妲同时是他的姑母。","name":"奥雷里亚诺·何塞","order":1,"photo_path":"photos/person_aureliano_jose.jpg","updated_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00"},"person_aureliano_last":{"created_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00","gender":"male","generation_id":"gen_demo2_07","id":"person_aureliano_last","introduction":"Aureliano。奥雷里亚诺·巴比伦与阿玛兰妲·乌尔苏拉的儿子，布恩迪亚家族的末代孩子；独立姓名标注用于与十七子及上校区分。","name":"奥雷里亚诺（末代）","order":0,"photo_path":"photos/person_aureliano_last.jpg","updated_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00"},"person_aureliano_segundo":{"created_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00","gender":"male","generation_id":"gen_demo2_04","id":"person_aureliano_segundo","introduction":"Aureliano Segundo。阿尔卡蒂奥与桑塔索菲亚的儿子，费尔南达的丈夫，三个第五代孩子的父亲；与佩特拉的伴侣关系只写在简介中。","name":"奥雷里亚诺第二","order":2,"photo_path":"photos/person_aureliano_segundo.jpg","updated_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00"},"person_colonel":{"created_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00","gender":"male","generation_id":"gen_demo2_02","id":"person_colonel","introduction":"Coronel Aureliano Buendía。创始夫妇的儿子，与庇拉尔生下奥雷里亚诺·何塞，另与不同母亲有十七名儿子。妻子是蕾梅黛丝·莫斯科特。","name":"奥雷里亚诺·布恩迪亚上校","order":1,"photo_path":"photos/person_colonel.jpg","updated_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00"},"person_fernanda":{"created_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00","gender":"female","generation_id":"gen_demo2_04","id":"person_fernanda","introduction":"Fernanda del Carpio。费尔南多与蕾娜塔的女儿，与奥雷里亚诺第二生下何塞第五代、梅梅和阿玛兰妲·乌尔苏拉。","name":"费尔南达·德尔·卡皮奥","order":3,"photo_path":"photos/person_fernanda.jpg","updated_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00"},"person_fernando":{"created_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00","gender":"male","generation_id":"gen_demo2_03","id":"person_fernando","introduction":"Fernando del Carpio。费尔南达的父亲，出身家道衰落的德尔·卡皮奥家庭。","name":"费尔南多·德尔·卡皮奥","order":3,"photo_path":"photos/person_fernando.jpg","updated_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00"},"person_founder":{"created_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00","gender":"male","generation_id":"gen_demo2_01","id":"person_founder","introduction":"José Arcadio Buendía。与乌尔苏拉共同建立马孔多的家族创始人。两人也是表亲，但本演示不虚构他们未列出的祖先。","name":"何塞·阿尔卡蒂奥·布恩迪亚","order":0,"photo_path":"photos/person_founder.jpg","updated_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00"},"person_gaston":{"created_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00","gender":"male","generation_id":"gen_demo2_05","id":"person_gaston","introduction":"Gastón。阿玛兰妲·乌尔苏拉的丈夫；本演示不加入夫妻边或未具名孩子，因此他可以是孤立节点。","name":"加斯通","order":4,"photo_path":"photos/person_gaston.jpg","updated_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00"},"person_jose_arcadio":{"created_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00","gender":"male","generation_id":"gen_demo2_02","id":"person_jose_arcadio","introduction":"José Arcadio。创始夫妇的儿子，与庇拉尔生下阿尔卡蒂奥，后来与养妹丽贝卡结婚；婚姻仅在简介中说明。","name":"何塞·阿尔卡蒂奥","order":0,"photo_path":"photos/person_jose_arcadio.jpg","updated_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00"},"person_jose_arcadio_v":{"created_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00","gender":"male","generation_id":"gen_demo2_05","id":"person_jose_arcadio_v","introduction":"José Arcadio。奥雷里亚诺第二与费尔南达的儿子，以第五代标注区别于同名祖辈。","name":"何塞·阿尔卡蒂奥（第五代）","order":0,"photo_path":"photos/person_jose_arcadio_v.jpg","updated_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00"},"person_jose_segundo":{"created_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00","gender":"male","generation_id":"gen_demo2_04","id":"person_jose_segundo","introduction":"José Arcadio Segundo。阿尔卡蒂奥与桑塔索菲亚的儿子，奥雷里亚诺第二的双胞胎兄弟，经历香蕉公司工人的命运。","name":"何塞·阿尔卡蒂奥第二","order":1,"photo_path":"photos/person_jose_segundo.jpg","updated_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00"},"person_mauricio":{"created_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00","gender":"male","generation_id":"gen_demo2_05","id":"person_mauricio","introduction":"Mauricio Babilonia。梅梅的恋人、奥雷里亚诺·巴比伦的父亲；西语全名用于区别父子。","name":"毛里西奥·巴比伦","order":3,"photo_path":"photos/person_mauricio.jpg","updated_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00"},"person_meme":{"created_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00","gender":"female","generation_id":"gen_demo2_05","id":"person_meme","introduction":"Renata Remedios（Meme）。奥雷里亚诺第二与费尔南达的女儿，与毛里西奥生下奥雷里亚诺·巴比伦。","name":"蕾娜塔·蕾梅黛丝（梅梅）","order":1,"photo_path":"photos/person_meme.jpg","updated_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00"},"person_nicanor_ulloa":{"created_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00","gender":"male","generation_id":"gen_demo2_01","id":"person_nicanor_ulloa","introduction":"Nicanor Ulloa。丽贝卡的亲生父亲，与布恩迪亚夫妇的养亲身份分开登记。","name":"尼卡诺尔·乌略亚","order":2,"photo_path":"photos/person_nicanor_ulloa.jpg","updated_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00"},"person_petra":{"created_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00","gender":"female","generation_id":"gen_demo2_04","id":"person_petra","introduction":"Petra Cotes。曾与双胞胎兄弟往来，长期与奥雷里亚诺第二相伴；伴侣关系仅保留在简介中，不编造亲子边。","name":"佩特拉·科特斯","order":4,"photo_path":"photos/person_petra.jpg","updated_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00"},"person_pilar":{"created_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00","gender":"female","generation_id":"gen_demo2_02","id":"person_pilar","introduction":"Pilar Ternera。阿尔卡蒂奥与奥雷里亚诺·何塞的母亲，两人的父亲分别为何塞·阿尔卡蒂奥与上校。","name":"庇拉尔·特尔内拉","order":4,"photo_path":"photos/person_pilar.jpg","updated_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00"},"person_rebeca":{"created_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00","gender":"female","generation_id":"gen_demo2_02","id":"person_rebeca","introduction":"Rebeca。尼卡诺尔·乌略亚与丽贝卡·蒙铁尔的女儿，由布恩迪亚夫妇收养，后来与何塞·阿尔卡蒂奥结婚。","name":"丽贝卡","order":3,"photo_path":"photos/person_rebeca.jpg","updated_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00"},"person_rebeca_montiel":{"created_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00","gender":"female","generation_id":"gen_demo2_01","id":"person_rebeca_montiel","introduction":"Rebeca Montiel。丽贝卡的亲生母亲；同名母女使用各自完整姓名消歧。","name":"丽贝卡·蒙铁尔","order":3,"photo_path":"photos/person_rebeca_montiel.jpg","updated_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00"},"person_remedios_beauty":{"created_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00","gender":"female","generation_id":"gen_demo2_04","id":"person_remedios_beauty","introduction":"Remedios la Bella。阿尔卡蒂奥与桑塔索菲亚的女儿；以‘美人儿’区别于第二代的蕾梅黛丝·莫斯科特。","name":"美人儿蕾梅黛丝","order":0,"photo_path":"photos/person_remedios_beauty.jpg","updated_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00"},"person_remedios_moscote":{"created_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00","gender":"female","generation_id":"gen_demo2_02","id":"person_remedios_moscote","introduction":"Remedios Moscote。阿波利纳尔的女儿、上校的妻子，接纳奥雷里亚诺·何塞为长子；她去世后阿玛兰妲收养了他。","name":"蕾梅黛丝·莫斯科特","order":5,"photo_path":"photos/person_remedios_moscote.jpg","updated_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00"},"person_renata_argote":{"created_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00","gender":"female","generation_id":"gen_demo2_03","id":"person_renata_argote","introduction":"Renata Argote。费尔南达的母亲，与费尔南多共同登记为她的亲生父母。","name":"蕾娜塔·阿尔戈特","order":4,"photo_path":"photos/person_renata_argote.jpg","updated_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00"},"person_santa_sofia":{"created_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00","gender":"female","generation_id":"gen_demo2_03","id":"person_santa_sofia","introduction":"Santa Sofía de la Piedad。阿尔卡蒂奥的伴侣，美人儿蕾梅黛丝及何塞第二、奥雷里亚诺第二的母亲。","name":"桑塔索菲亚·德拉·彼达","order":2,"photo_path":"photos/person_santa_sofia.jpg","updated_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00"},"person_ursula":{"created_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00","gender":"female","generation_id":"gen_demo2_01","id":"person_ursula","introduction":"Úrsula Iguarán。何塞·阿尔卡蒂奥·布恩迪亚的妻子与表亲，长期维系家族生活。她与丈夫收养丽贝卡。","name":"乌尔苏拉·伊瓜兰","order":1,"photo_path":"photos/person_ursula.jpg","updated_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00"}},"relationships":[{"child_id":"person_jose_arcadio","child_label":"儿子","code":"father_son","color_key":"father-son","created_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00","id":"rel_founder__jose_arcadio","kind":"standard","parent_id":"person_founder","parent_label":"爸爸","updated_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00"},{"child_id":"person_colonel","child_label":"儿子","code":"father_son","color_key":"father-son","created_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00","id":"rel_founder__colonel","kind":"standard","parent_id":"person_founder","paren